; A number-only price takes the cost currency of its account's lots, which
; puts it in the same Currency group as an augmentation at {} beside it:
; that cost is then interpolated from the price's weight, and is negative.
option "booking_method" "HIFO"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Equity:Open

2020-01-02 * "Lot a"
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL {10 USD}
  Equity:Open

2020-02-01 * "Beside an augmentation at {}"
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL @ 1.5
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL {}
